    "title": "A Generational Love Letter to Western Hills Mall - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By NaBeela Washington ,\n10 hours ago The buckets were the first thing I noticed. Three of them were scattered near the main entrance of Western Hills Mall, catching water from a ceiling that was supposed to have been fixed three years ago. It was January 31, 2026, and the cold that hit me walking through those doors wasn't winter. It was absence. Read full article\n1",
